<h2>What the guarantee means for your order</h2>
<p>Buying tickets online should not feel like a gamble. Seat Outlet orders are fulfilled through TicketNetwork and covered by its 100% guarantee. You can read TicketNetwork's wording in its <a href="https://www.ticketnetwork.com/policies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies</a>, and our <a href="/ticket-buyer-protection">buyer protection page</a> repeats the same terms.</p>

