  <figure><img src="/images/event-ticket-buying.webp" alt="Concert tickets on a laptop and a phone, with a green check mark on the phone ticket" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Your confirmation email has your order number.</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><img src="/images/crowd-at-concert-or-event.webp" alt="Fans cheering at a live event" width="442" height="442" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The goal is simple: you enjoy the event.</figcaption></figure>
